WEBVTT

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.260
Lost in the direction of a vast road ahead

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:27.300
Want to escape the cycle, be myself for once

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.400
Crashing into a chaotic world

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.690
Ever since I met you, my course has changed

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.940
Define the world as infinity

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.460
No need to be suspicious

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.160
No need to doubt

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.500
You're light, I'm darkness, in mutual opposition

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.780
Like the opposite ends of magnets

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.740
In natural tacit agreement

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.480
Quarrel gets reconciled in split seconds

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:02.420
Can't see and can't hear in subtlety

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:07.720
You know what I'm thinking

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.980
Your trust is burning

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.060
is my smiling response to the world

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.360
Relying on each other

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.960
Vast potential to rewrite life

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.860
May be unexpected

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.820
In every circumstance

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:33.500
To face all battles together

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.400
Let the chains that bound us together

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.340
Converge into an unlimited, exciting

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:45.520
Splendor

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.440
Soul Contract

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:54.200
Sixth Contract

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:04.200
Hey hey

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.160
As the Yangming Master's Soul Image

00:02:06.168 --> 00:02:08.059
Even if you're a weakling

00:02:08.059 --> 00:02:10.090
You should at least have a little gut

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.600
Come over to face your death

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.730
You think I'm an idiot because I look cute?

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:16.647
Only a scumbag would choose to end other people's life

00:02:16.647 --> 00:02:17.490
Damn it

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.856
Duanmu that bastard

00:02:18.856 --> 00:02:21.524
Trapping me here using a freaking spell

00:02:22.226 --> 00:02:23.024
Hmph!

00:02:23.024 --> 00:02:24.244
A wimp

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:26.368
Serves you right for being servile

00:02:26.368 --> 00:02:29.977
Today I'll teach you how to be a real man

00:02:29.977 --> 00:02:31.026
Don't force me

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.040
I have principles

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.260
First, I don't beat women

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:34.660
Second, I don't beat kids

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.340
You're a spirit, you aren't qualified to preach

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.240
Oh yeah

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:38.960
Duanmu said

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.740
I can't judge spirits by their looks

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:41.760
You may look small

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.308
You're probably an old granny

00:02:43.308 --> 00:02:45.960
Then take this Child Abandonment Punch

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:46.620
Lil' brat

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.360
Let me show you how spicy an old ginger tastes

00:02:49.952 --> 00:02:50.967
Begone

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:56.560
Did Duanmu find a clown to entertain him?

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.420
Such a ruthless strike

00:02:58.423 --> 00:03:00.345
Can't have any babies even as a ghost

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.780
You wanna make me one of Qiaofeng brothers (martial arts character)

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.100
who forego pleasures

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.532
Still stubborn?

00:03:05.532 --> 00:03:08.424
I know you're feeling bleak from afar (*Dandan yo-ushang = Feel bleak)

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.980
The pain on my balls got nothing to do with you (*Dandan youshang = Pain on balls)

00:03:11.988 --> 00:03:13.267
Who are you guys

00:03:13.267 --> 00:03:15.065
Why do you taunt me?

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:17.960
Lord Yinzhe already said he's no longer interested in you

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:21.340
So you don't deserve to know he's king of 10,000 youkais

00:03:21.351 --> 00:03:22.512
Enough, Huayu

00:03:22.512 --> 00:03:23.804
No use chitchatting

00:03:23.804 --> 00:03:26.773
This pooch, chained within the boundary by his master,

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:29.153
can't even obtain the basic trust

00:03:29.153 --> 00:03:32.086
Just snuff him out painlessly

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.500
King of 10,000 youkais?

00:03:35.276 --> 00:03:36.360
Great

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.020
I almost forgot about the nature of my work

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:40.220
being an exorcist

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:44.220
I'll show you the technique passed down by my ancestors

00:03:44.227 --> 00:03:45.271
Tcih!

00:03:45.271 --> 00:03:47.833
This kind of hapless trick

00:03:47.833 --> 00:03:50.333
can only be used to fool old people

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.755
Thunder Strike Burning Earth

00:03:54.755 --> 00:03:56.661
Death by Plunging into River

00:03:56.661 --> 00:03:59.698
Consider this my lucky day, or your tough luck

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.100
A mouse spotted by a cat

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.340
A thief caught red-handed

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:04.550
My family

00:04:04.556 --> 00:04:07.165
is the forerunner of your mortal enemy

00:04:08.052 --> 00:04:10.927
So you're finally showing your true power

00:04:11.133 --> 00:04:12.036
Duanmu Xi

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:15.740
Let's see how great your chosen Soul Image really is

00:04:20.208 --> 00:04:21.821
Not done chanting?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.300
Save me!!!

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.560
A ghost murderer!!!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.800
A youkai has trespassed!!!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.060
Somebody come quick!!!

00:04:37.067 --> 00:04:38.520
body come quick!!!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.332
come quick!!!

00:04:40.332 --> 00:04:42.173
quick!!!

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:45.950
Lord Yinzhe

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.520
What was that?

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:51.820
- It's probably just a simple call for help
- There's a youkai, come quickly! A ghost is dying!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:55.480
Hey, friend! Get your family most powerful exorcist over here!

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.860
- Have you seen young Master Xi's Soul Image?
- Hey, you hear?!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.120
- Nope, too bad I didn't
- I'm here! Hey, look at me!

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:01.780
Hey

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.420
Here

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:03.500
Look here

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.040
Stop wasting your energy

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.690
You twerp

00:05:07.696 --> 00:05:10.623
If I plan to loiter around this huge Duanmu residence

00:05:10.623 --> 00:05:12.322
without any youkai spells,

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:15.400
how can I hack my way through the security barrier?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.430
We'll find an excuse to have a peek near the master's room

00:05:18.436 --> 00:05:21.902
I heard he's a very talented handsome boy

00:05:22.415 --> 00:05:23.278
Look

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.420
What is that?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.570
A monkey?

00:05:25.837 --> 00:05:28.854
A wild monkey from the mountains has entered the yard

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.150
Let's go

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:31.980
Nothing to be surprised at

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:33.462
Monkey your arse

00:05:33.462 --> 00:05:34.811
I'm your Master Yang

00:05:34.811 --> 00:05:35.340
Hey

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:36.306
Come back here

00:05:36.306 --> 00:05:37.697
Come back...

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:39.630
Lord Yinzhe

00:05:39.635 --> 00:05:41.483
This guy looks idiotic

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:44.700
It's useless even if we try to provoke him

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:45.200
Hmph!

00:05:45.496 --> 00:05:48.541
I don't believe Duanmu would choose an idiot

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:50.460
Don't treat him lightly

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:51.370
Lord Yinzhe

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.400
Are you getting fretful of Duanmu Xi?

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:56.640
He probably might have picked up a wild ghost by the roadside

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:57.830
to please his family

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.350
Who you calling a wild ghost?

00:05:59.352 --> 00:06:00.754
I'll slice you b*tch

00:06:00.754 --> 00:06:01.865
When did he?

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.280
Hmph

00:06:07.283 --> 00:06:09.504
I knew it's not that easy

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:13.720
All the noises he made was to let down our guard

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.220
Damn it

00:06:16.223 --> 00:06:18.566
Can't believe I got fooled by a brat

00:06:18.566 --> 00:06:20.472
I'm going serious now

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:24.840
Prepare to be f*cked by the spirit energy sword in my hand

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.000
Show your weapon

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.150
and fight

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.400
Balala Power

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.060
Transform

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.430
Huh?

00:06:35.433 --> 00:06:38.120
She transformed into a beautiful lady in seconds

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:38.139
The older I transformed
She transformed into a beautiful lady in seconds

00:06:38.139 --> 00:06:40.040
The older I transformed

00:06:40.045 --> 00:06:42.201
The more powerful I become

00:06:42.201 --> 00:06:44.609
Previously I was using the skills of a kid

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:45.540
Now

00:06:45.545 --> 00:06:48.170
I'll seriously execute you

00:06:48.402 --> 00:06:49.294
Come

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.440
I'll use this Wanji Umbrella

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:53.320
to fight against you

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.200
Young Master

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.880
Who is it?

00:07:08.239 --> 00:07:09.176
Young Master

00:07:09.176 --> 00:07:10.223
You're awake

00:07:10.459 --> 00:07:11.617
Pardon me

00:07:11.617 --> 00:07:13.081
Is there any concern?

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:14.140
Nothing

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.300
I received a report by the domestic workers

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.530
They said a wild monkey from the mountains has trespassed the yard

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:20.940
I worry you'd get disturbed

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:21.780
So I decide

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.350
to check on you

00:07:23.585 --> 00:07:24.724
Wild monkey?

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:27.599
The mountains are full of dangerous youkai

00:07:27.599 --> 00:07:29.758
How did a monkey get here?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.440
Tomorrow I'll

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.260
send people to investigate the mountains

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.500
Don't you worry

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:35.800
Alright

00:07:35.801 --> 00:07:37.474
You should go rest soon

00:07:37.474 --> 00:07:39.476
Thank you for your concern

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:40.580
Good night

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.220
Seems like you're still incompetent

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.840
You yield your sword like a broom

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.440
Why does Xi accept you?

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:57.400
Enough, Huayu

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.280
I know you've waited many years

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.140
hoping to be Duanmu Xi's Soul Image

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.580
but this guy occupied first

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.060
You must be unhappy

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.310
Why do I feel a potent threat coming from this guy?

00:08:07.314 --> 00:08:09.362
He seems mighty

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.900
yet there's a mix of human spiritual energy

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.420
and a vicious raging youkai energy in him

00:08:14.753 --> 00:08:15.614
Kid

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.340
I

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.420
am a thousand-year-old fox spirit

00:08:19.706 --> 00:08:22.456
but some knowledgeable spirits knew

00:08:22.456 --> 00:08:25.912
I used to be a Yangming Master's Soul Image

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.540
But now

00:08:28.824 --> 00:08:33.326
I'm the king of this mountain

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.010
Get off your high horse!

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:40.240
You don't even feel scared

00:08:40.248 --> 00:08:42.196
You have some courage

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.520
I'm starting to like you

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.630
Well then

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:48.040
how about if I eat you like this?

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.620
Even though you're weak

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:53.720
but you still have a bit of spiritual power transferred by a Yangming Master

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.630
Let's give a taste

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.417
Stop it

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.460
You've finally come

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.150
Duanmu Xi

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:05.440
Xi

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.830
You create rattles on my rooftop in middle of the night

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.480
You're giving me sleeplessness

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.860
Sorry to disturb your sleep

00:09:13.863 --> 00:09:17.222
We just want to get acquainted with the new Soul Image

00:09:17.222 --> 00:09:19.831
and congratulate the Duanmu master

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:22.590
who finally found a substitute spirit

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.760
I don't like the way you call me

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:25.610
Therefore

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:27.880
if you don't disappear from here

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:28.730
then

00:09:28.739 --> 00:09:30.364
I'll make you disappear

00:09:30.865 --> 00:09:31.644
Xi

00:09:31.644 --> 00:09:33.853
If you plan to go against Lord Yinzhe

00:09:33.853 --> 00:09:35.317
you must go through me first

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:36.880
Go away

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.580
You better go back to your mountains

00:09:42.822 --> 00:09:43.901
Why

00:09:44.137 --> 00:09:46.729
is my body unwillingly trembles

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:50.520
Who's the one talking about executing me now?

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.220
Come on

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.160
Show your spunk

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:54.250
Beat me up

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:55.180
Yang Jinghua

00:09:55.189 --> 00:09:56.626
You should get off too

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:57.370
What?

00:09:57.375 --> 00:09:58.267
Why?

00:09:58.260 --> 00:09:59.740
I told to get off, you get off

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.890
You hear?!

00:10:02.096 --> 00:10:03.159
Sure

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.880
They aren't really going to fight, are they?

00:10:10.885 --> 00:10:12.365
If they really fight

00:10:12.365 --> 00:10:15.081
He should be fine, right?

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.820
Letting these 2 monkeys in

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.460
somehow makes it useful

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:24.800
Thanks for your effort

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.090
Brother Siming

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:29.320
I'd do anything for this family

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:30.450
As for the rest

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:33.700
we'll see what kind of mess they will get into

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.290
Long time no see

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.020
I never expect to meet you

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:38.900
at such an awkward moment

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:39.920
I'm warning you

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.700
Don't you dare pester him again

00:10:42.018 --> 00:10:43.814
Sure~ I understand

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.660
I don't want to get into trouble

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.400
fighting you and causing disturbance to your family

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.430
Besides

00:10:49.439 --> 00:10:51.003
it's a cool night

00:10:51.003 --> 00:10:53.799
Don't you feel cold wearing this little?

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:55.530
The human body

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:57.800
is quite fragile

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.860
You do realize this, don't you?

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.420
Young Master Xi

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:05.130
Lord Yinzhe!

00:11:05.371 --> 00:11:06.320
Hey hey

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:08.026
Why so serious?

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.720
You become so dreary after marrying a Soul Image?

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:14.240
The issues between us are not for you to butt in

00:11:14.241 --> 00:11:16.088
Likewise, tell your people

00:11:16.088 --> 00:11:17.740
to leave him alone

00:11:19.257 --> 00:11:21.550
You're such an interesting guy

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.344
Soul Images are meant to protect Yangming Masters

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.310
but instead

00:11:26.312 --> 00:11:28.858
you're the one protecting him

00:11:29.223 --> 00:11:31.203
Taking in a pack rat

00:11:31.203 --> 00:11:34.124
don't you feel too much of a burden?

00:11:34.365 --> 00:11:37.547
You should at least find someone who's great as me

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:40.300
Actually, I don't intend to get a Soul Image

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.793
As for Yang Jinghua's case

00:11:41.793 --> 00:11:43.716
you don't need to know

00:11:43.998 --> 00:11:44.919
Leave

00:11:44.919 --> 00:11:46.451
and don't come again

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.050
Duanmu Xi

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.820
If you change your mind

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.420
and plan to find another suitable Soul Image

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.880
You could always look for me

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.870
Head priest

00:11:59.105 --> 00:12:00.795
Don't you forget

00:12:01.074 --> 00:12:04.169
Everything about this mountain and Duanmu household

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.760
including you

00:12:06.136 --> 00:12:08.434
belong to me

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:12.230
This is the fate of Yangming Masters

00:12:12.592 --> 00:12:14.919
that none can escape

00:12:16.675 --> 00:12:18.377
Still not back yet?

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.781
The previous Soul Image

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.810
must be a really formidable guy

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.160
Sigh

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.560
As for me

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:27.650
He's back

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:29.020
How was it?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.000
Did you win?

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.550
Why are you worried about me?

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:33.960
If I lose,

00:12:33.964 --> 00:12:35.642
can you fight for me?

00:12:36.125 --> 00:12:37.603
Last night

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:39.200
all your nasty relatives

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.040
and a thousand-year-old fox spirit...

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.100
Why do I feel that you have terrible relationships with everyone?

00:12:44.104 --> 00:12:44.996
Hmph!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.060
So what?

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.040
It doesn't matter how they think of me

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:50.240
All they care is to rely on me for livelihood

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.240
Without me

00:12:51.242 --> 00:12:52.698
this family is gone

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:55.190
The weak depends on the strong to survive

00:12:55.197 --> 00:12:57.680
It's the way the world operates

00:13:02.519 --> 00:13:03.501
Duanmu Xi

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.360
Don't be so full of yourself

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.720
The world still spins even if you don't exist

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.650
Hmph!

00:13:08.658 --> 00:13:10.796
What are you implying

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.560
and what's with that attitude?

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.180
Duanmu Xi

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.180
It's true that

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:16.730
you're strong

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.180
but you also said

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:21.000
the spirits are after your powers with their prying eyes

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.120
If I

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.220
take all your powers away

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:27.980
Tell me

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.910
what's going to happen?

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.940
Don't you ever forget

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:38.340
I'm one of them too

00:13:41.260 --> 00:14:01.760
